        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R2310, 3 Inch x 10 Inch Classic Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of brass, this 3x10 Floor Register is great for adding a touch of classic beauty to any home. That's why its called the classic--because its elegant design will fit nicely among any traditional home decor. This Classic 3 Inch x 10 Inch Register with Damper controls the airflow in your room with an easy to adjust toggle. It is easy to install in an existing or new 3 inch x 10 inch floor opening. Choose from Brass Accent's timeless finishes including weathered black, satin nickel, and polished brass. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/classic-4-inch-x-10-inch-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r2410\"<b>4 Inch x 10 Inch Classic Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/classic-4-inch-x-12-inch-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r2412\"<b>4 Inch x 12 Inch Classic Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/classic-4-inch-x-14-inch-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r2414\"<b>4 Inch x 14 Inch Classic Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Classic 3 Inch x 10 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>.  See available <a href=\"/collections/vents-and-registers\"><b>Vents and Registers</b></a>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
